// Source: Source: Yann Ollivier, public-domain two-part Jingle Bells, https://www.yann-ollivier.org/Music/jb.pdf
// Flute melody and original cello bass retain the PD duet. Strings add specifically harmonised clear F/Dm/C7/Bb passages, leaving chromatic passing bars open. Glockenspiel colours the first chorus phrase in the upper octave; tambourine and a few triangle phrase accents provide Christmas rhythm. No choir and no copied full-score layer. Standard GM, CC7=100; no custom banks.
// Musicbox title: Jingle%20Bells
